- 💬 **Segregated chat** – the watched stream’s chat + your own broadcast chat (simulated viewer messages)
- 🖱️ **Resizable panels** – drag borders to prioritise what matters

Everything is pure client‑side, signalled with `BroadcastChannel` – open extra tabs to simulate viewers & remote callers.

